proton-autogen (3.1.5) noble; urgency=medium

  * Thanks to all users and contributors for their continued support, feedback and encouragement throughout the development of proton-autogen.
  * Improved overall UX stability and refined GTK4 interface behavior.
  * Added GPU Extreme performance profile with advanced AMD and NVIDIA optimizations.
  * Added balanced, performance and extreme GPU profiles with improved hardware detection.
  * Improved AMD RADV optimization handling with ACO, GPL and SAM support.
  * Improved NVIDIA shader cache management and performance tuning.
  * Added additional multilingual translations across the application interface.
  * Improved translation consistency and language fallback handling.
  * Added multi-threaded UX loading system to improve application startup performance.
  * Optimized game library loading with asynchronous resource initialization.
  * Improved icon loading performance and reduced UI blocking during startup.
  * Improved game list rendering and GTK4 responsiveness.
  * Added deferred loading mechanisms for heavy UI components.
  * Improved dashboard initialization and overall application startup time.
  * Stabilized game detection, profile loading and configuration synchronization.
  * Improved Proton runtime management and compatibility handling.
  * Enhanced Steam compatibility environment variable support.
  * Improved GPU environment generation and profile selection logic.
  * Added additional graphics stack optimizations for AMD, NVIDIA and Mesa.
  * Improved DXVK, VKD3D, Wine and Proton configuration handling.
  * Improved MangoHud and GameMode integration stability.
  * Enhanced diagnostics and runtime logging reliability.
  * Improved subprocess management and launch session tracking.
  * Fixed various GTK4 layout, refresh and UI consistency issues.
  * Fixed configuration loading race conditions.
  * Fixed several translation and localization issues.
  * General performance improvements and internal code cleanup.

